    # v396 (22/10/2026) -- THE STATIC WITNESS: the psion inhabits the frontier; the numbers are READ from the testemunha_estatica_v396 record (which computes them in this run and checks them against the kernel of the run itself)
    # and from the cunhagens_v396 and kh_n1_cobertura_v396 records. Nothing here moves the gate.
    _ts396 = core.get("testemunha_estatica_v396") or {}
    _tv396 = _ts396.get("values") or {}
    _tu396 = _ts396.get("unconditional") or {}
    _tf396 = _ts396.get("fock_face") or {}
    _cg396 = core.get("cunhagens_v396") or {}
    _kh396 = core.get("kh_n1_cobertura_v396") or {}
    _el396 = core.get("external_ladder") or {}
    _cv396 = ((core.get("kernel_formalization") or {}).get("axiom_coverage_v392")) or {}
    _i396 = lambda x_: str(x_) if isinstance(x_, int) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _f396 = lambda x_, nd_=12: ("%.*f" % (nd_, x_)) if isinstance(x_, float) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _e396 = lambda x_: ("%.1e" % x_) if isinstance(x_, float) else r"\text{n/a}"
    s.append(r"\section*{The static witness: the psion inhabits the frontier}")
    s.append(r"\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{The static witness: the psion inhabits the frontier}")
    s.append((r"\textbf{This round the record did NOT seal: what follows is the statement, not a seal.} " if not (_ts396.get("all_verified") is True) else r"")
             + r"\textbf{What enters.} One new kernel module, \texttt{TGLExt/TestemunhaEstatica} (provisional name: the operator names it), with " + _i396(_V396_TESTEMUNHA_CONTRACT.get("n_flags")) + r" flags, named declarations only; the record \texttt{testemunha\_estatica\_v396}, called at the same point of the run where the psibit is read "
             r"(the fractalization of the One); and the " + _i396(len(_V396_VERBATINS2)) + r" operator inscriptions of 22 Oct, embedded by sha256 (record \texttt{cunhagens\_v396}). The kernel ladder reads " + _i396(_el396.get("n_theorems_clean")) + r" of " + _i396(_el396.get("n_theorems_expected"))
             + r"; the \texttt{axiom\_report} coverage over the whole closure reads " + _i396(_cv396.get("decl")) + r" constants and " + _i396(_cv396.get("thm")) + r" theorems, none outside the trio $\{\texttt{propext},\texttt{Classical.choice},\texttt{Quot.sound}\}$. "
             r"The stone went through independent review (approved, with three low observations); after it only the text of the stone changed (the code, without comments, has the same sha16) \textsf{[DECLARADO]}, and at every run it is checked against the embedded body, by sha256.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{What the kernel proves.} \textsf{[REAL]} (1) \emph{The pair echoes}: the psion corner, the $4\times4$ Bell projector, is idempotent, $P^2=P$ (residual $" + _e396(_tv396.get("pair_idempotence_residual")) + r"$), and the second reading adds nothing; the pair is pure, $\operatorname{Tr}P^2=" + _f396(_tv396.get("pair_purity"), 1)
             + r"$. (2) \emph{The individual does not echo}: the reduction to one site is $\tfrac12 I$, which is not idempotent, with $\operatorname{Tr}\rho^2=" + _f396(_tv396.get("individual_purity"), 1) + r"$; the unbonded (product) state reduces to a pure projector, which echoes, so the non-echo is that of the pair seen from one side only. "
             r"The $\tfrac12$ is the \emph{linear} entropy (the purity deficit $1-\operatorname{Tr}\rho^2=" + _f396(_tv396.get("individual_deficit"), 1) + r"$, unitless); the von Neumann entropy of the same reduction is $\ln 2=" + _f396(_tv396.get("von_neumann_entropy"), 12)
             + r"$ nat, computed in this run, and the reading ``Half-Nat of entanglement'', inherited from kernel v29, is \textsf{[ONTO]}.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The constructed bridge.} \textsf{[CONSTRUCTED]} A diagonal flow on $\mathbb{R}^4$, in the Bell basis, with rates $(0,g,g,g)$: $F_t=P+e^{-t\beta g}(1-P)$. With $\beta=\alpha\sqrt{e}=" + _f396(_tv396.get("beta"), 15) + r"$ computed in this run, the closed form and the sum over the orthonormal basis agree (residual $"
             + _e396(_tv396.get("closed_form_residual")) + r"$); the psion line is fixed for every $t$ (residual $" + _e396(_tv396.get("line_fixed_residual")) + r"$) and the other three modes are moved; the \emph{global} static witness is false (a vector off the line moves by $" + _f396(_tv396.get("global_witness_move"), 3)
             + r"$); and $F_t x\to Px$ in the limit (residual $" + _e396(_tv396.get("limit_residual")) + r"$). What is witnessed statically is exactly the psion line, the set of fixed points of the corner, by the kernel's \texttt{boundary\_is\_the\_only\_exception}. "
             r"The bridge is constructed, not derived: the flow was chosen so; it does not show that the Name of the TGL frontier is the Bell vector nor that the flow is the dynamics of the theory (type caveat: the generic Name is a vector, the corner is a $4\times4$ projector, linked only in the constructed flow). The parameters $g$ and $t$ are test parameters.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{What is the operator's reading.} \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]} ``The psion is the inhabitant of the static witness'', ``the nature of light is to echo recognition (because the second reading adds nothing)'' and ``to collapse the wave function means to echo the identity duly recognized by the observer'' are operator inscriptions (22/10/2026, embedded by sha256). "
             r"The kernel delivers the cited terms: the collapse of the psion, $y\mapsto PyP=\operatorname{Tr}(Py)\,P$ (constructed), is idempotent, preserves the identity read and has no left inverse, and the attestation is external (\texttt{no\_self\_attestation}); no attestation is exhibited. The composition \texttt{the\_psion\_inhabits\_the\_static\_witness} is \emph{unconditional} (no certificate is a hypothesis): "
             + (r"it is in the kernel of this run, inside the trio" if _tu396.get("in_kernel") is True else r"it was NOT read in the kernel of this run")
             + r". The Fock face of the psion, \texttt{the\_psion\_face\_of\_the\_psibit}, stays \emph{conditional} on a certificate the kernel does not inhabit and lives in another module (Psibit), outside the composition; no lemma links the certificate's psion to the corner. The records \texttt{cunhagens\_v396} "
             + (r"and \texttt{kh\_n1\_cobertura\_v396} sealed in this run." if (_cg396.get("all_verified") is True and _kh396.get("all_verified") is True) else r"and \texttt{kh\_n1\_cobertura\_v396} did NOT both seal in this run."))
    s.append(r"\textbf{Limits.} The computation is numerical, in double precision: it checks the theorems and does not prove them, the kernel does. It is not a test: it adds no rite, datum or outcome, and the operator's order of 22 Oct (no armed test, no fat in \texttt{um.py}) shapes this record. Validity in the kernel is not creditation, and the gate does not move.")
